# ── Line endings + diff stability (Qodo) ──────────────────────────────
# Force LF text normalization on every text asset so Windows/CRLF
# contributors never produce noisy diffs. Binary assets are left as-is
# (diff=astextplain gives readable Git diffs for them instead of "Binary
# files differ"). Mark Dart / YAML / XML / SH as text explicitly.
* text=auto eol=lf
# NOTE (CodeRabbit): gitattributes does NOT support brace {a,b} glob
# expansion — every pattern must be listed explicitly.
*.dart text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.env text eol=lf
*.png binary diff=astextplain
*.jpg binary diff=astextplain
*.jpeg binary diff=astextplain
*.gif binary diff=astextplain
*.webp binary diff=astextplain
*.ico binary diff=astextplain
*.ttf binary diff=astextplain
*.otf binary diff=astextplain
*.woff binary diff=astextplain
*.woff2 binary diff=astextplain
# NO union merge driver (CodeRabbit): `pubspec.lock` is a generated
# resolution snapshot — a union merge would silently concatenate conflicting
# resolution entries into a CORRUPT lockfile. Regenerate it instead
# (`flutter pub get`) and commit the result.
